2. DERIVED DATA  (web/data/*, data/*, the /llm/ API) — CC BY 4.0
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

The Groundwater Status Index (GWI), the legacy drought risk score, the
glacier/snow corridor products and every other value computed by this
project are released under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International licence: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Suggested attribution:
  "GW Power / groundwater-at.exe.xyz (CC BY 4.0), built on eHYD, EEA WISE,
   Wasserschatz Österreich, Copernicus EDO, Statistik Austria, WGMS, RGI,
   GeoSphere Austria and others."

Exception: everything derived from MERIT-Hydro / MERIT-Basins catchments
via mghydro.com (the "Your river's catchment" panels and the glacier-fed
reach layer, web/data/*catchment* / *reach*) inherits CC BY-NC-SA and may
NOT be reused commercially.

The index is a research product: interpolated, not measured. No warranty of
fitness for regulatory, legal or investment decisions.

